From 27073a9af94bb62cbc6bcbd977e10a65b066e805 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Viktor Ai <viktor@viktor.com>
Date: Sun, 21 Jun 2026 01:54:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(mvp): tiered schemas + all-tier cables, MV/HV machine
 assembly, orphan/dedupe cleanup

- Materials: honest_steel (LV) & pokhuit (MV) get cableProperties; new
  crystallized_dodik_sweat (HV) conductor material.
- Items: dodik_board (LV), lyudskaya_board (MV), zapizdosh_mainframe (HV)
  cascading crafting schemas (+ placeholder textures, models, en/ru lang).
- Machine assembly: LV/MV/HV recipes for all 4 singleblock machines using
  tier schema + tier cable (replaces free circuitMeta selectors).
- PUKAN_CORE early ASSEMBLER source (variant B) -> Skufizator buildable in MVP.
- pravilnaya_vesh & myposhko now consume lyudskaya_board instead of circuitMeta.
- MVP orphan fixes: condensed_sweat source (centrifuge), crystallized_dodik_sweat
  source, ugar_gas scrubber sink.
- Dedupe: removed ELECTROLYZER correct_matter recipe; POT_DISTILLERY is canonical.
