+    /**
+     * Tiered crafting schemas (addon-only "circuits"). Cascading: each tier consumes
+     * the previous board, so the player progresses LV -> MV -> HV. These are used ONLY
+     * in our own machine-assembly recipes; GregTech's own circuits are untouched.
